ulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0KTwW1eC1YAjR-zDr8w4jA","review_id":"8FnMJ9irN__Nw8iKmOoBNg","date":"2020-11-17T03:12:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9361682534217834,"text_excerpt":"Had a delicious lunch here recently. It's a big place, with plenty of room for social distancing, and everything seems very clean. It's also conveniently located mere feet from a streetcar stop. Bring a sweater though; it can get chilly inside. I tried the fried shrimp platter. The spicy breaded shrimp comes with hush puppies, coleslaw, tartar and cocktail sauce, buttered toast, and a lush pile of thick steak fries with melted garlic butter drizzle. An epic plate of food. The hush puppies may well have been my favorite part--sweet, crisp, and perfect. The price to portion ratio here is spot on; there was enough to take home and it made a nice dinner. The server/bartender, Lety, was a tota..."},{"business_id":"0KTwW1eC1YAjR-zDr8w4jA","review_id":"xfh-ZdZC1aszfPssS1LcAQ","date":"2018-05-15T22:02:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9335018396377563,"text_excerpt":"This place is pretty good. I have been to a few of their locations. They have a huge dining room and service tends to be quick. The poboys are pretty big but not the hugest I've had in town. The BBQ shrimp poboy is stuffed inside of the bread, uniquely. The fries are really good here, they are steak fries topped with a garlic butter sauce. Some dishes, like the fish tacos, are super small. Others, like the fried seafood platters are huge, especially if you pick the onion fries. I like the giant goblets of beer they serve for $5. Nothing here will blow you away but it is a sure crowd pleaser for picky eaters."},{"business_id":"0KTwW1eC1YAjR-zDr8w4jA","review_id":"6fzkmKZnTA9Wox9XUTzpWQ","date":"2014-04-17T15:52:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9320465922355652,"text_excerpt":"This has got to be one of the most unassuming chain restaurants in the area. I was not excited to dine here with all the other options available in the area, but ended up pleasantly surprised. The first time I dined here, we ate and had a few drinks at the bar. The bartender was friendly, the place was busy but not loud or crowded and it was CLEAN! Triple score! After a few refreshing Abitas I ordered the roast beef classic po-boy. It was huge, messy and delicious. The garlic fries are phenomenal as well - piping hot and dripping with buttery, garlic goodness. A few days ago we ordered large amounts of food to go so we could eat at home in our pajamas. Again, I was skeptical that we would..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0KTwW1eC1YAjR-zDr8w4jA","photo_id":"Mfab82TnfqsETxm541NTVA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Mfab82TnfqsETxm541NTVA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8756922483444214},{"business_id":"0KTwW1eC1YAjR-zDr8w4jA","photo_id":"Kcef5gD26wWIj_Z_cjSBOQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Kcef5gD26wWIj_Z_cjSBOQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8449757695198059},{"business_id":"0KTwW1eC1YAjR-zDr8w4jA","photo_id":"y4O5REagrhwF5MvCHNQ9rQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/y4O5REagrhwF5MvCHNQ9rQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8448458313941956},{"business_id":"0KTwW1eC